<div class="sqs-html-content" data-sqsp-text-block-content>
  <h1 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">ONE WORLD Impact Summit&nbsp;Agenda</h1><h2 style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Welcome to the 2020 Virtual Impact Summit! </h2><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">We’re thrilled you have joined us. Agenda below, which includes contact information of the pitching entrepreneurs. You can also find the full participant list on the bottom of this page.</p><p class="" data-rte-preserve-empty="true" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"></p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>11am:</strong>&nbsp;Welcome &amp; Kick Off with&nbsp;<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/morgan-simon/">&nbsp;</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/scott-d-saslow-46620/">Scott Saslow</a>, CEO &amp; Founder and&nbsp;<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/angelinamertens/">Angie Mertens</a>, Program Director,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.oneworld.training/">ONE WORLD Training &amp; Investments</a></p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>11:15am</strong>: Fireside Chat and Q&amp;A with&nbsp;<a href="https://www.westlygroup.com/stevewestly">Steve Westly</a>,&nbsp;Founder &amp; Managing Partner,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.westlygroup.com/">The Westly Group</a>&nbsp;</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>Noon:</strong>&nbsp;Founder Pitches Round I&nbsp;<em>(</em><a href="https://www.oneworld.training/demo-day"><em>get more info on each company</em></a><em>)</em></p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Bailey Farren, Co-Founder &amp; CEO, <a href="https://fireperimeter.com/" target="_blank">Perimeter</a>: bailey@fireperimeter.com&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">George Eleftheriou, Co-Founder &amp; CEO, <a href="https://www.myfeel.co/">Sentio Solutions</a>: george@myfeel.co&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Emily Bailard, CEO, <a href="https://everydaylabs.com/" target="_blank">EveryDay Labs</a>: emily@everydaylabs.com&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Andrew Hsieh, Co-Founder &amp; CEO, <a href="https://www.feasible.io/" target="_blank">Feasible</a>: andrew@feasible.io&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Jerry Nemorin, Founder &amp; CEO, <a href="https://www.lendstreet.com/">LendStreet</a>: jerry.nemorin@lendstreet.com&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>12:30pm</strong>: Judges feedback round I</p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/shripriya/">Shripriya Mahesh</a>, Founding Partner,&nbsp;<a href="https://spero.vc/">Spero Ventures</a></p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/joshecohen/">Josh Cohen</a>, Managing Partner,&nbsp;<a href="https://citylight.vc/">City Light Capital</a></p></li></ul><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>1:00pm</strong>: Breakout sessions</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">A. <strong><em>Climate Investing During The Health Crisis</em></strong>  <br>Facilitated by&nbsp;<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dankalafatas/">Dan Kalafatas</a>, Co-Founder &amp; Chairman,&nbsp;<a href="https://3degreesinc.com/services/?utm_source=adwords&amp;utm_medium=search&amp;utm_campaign=Branded&amp;utm_term=3degrees&amp;utm_content=3degrees&amp;gclid=Cj0KCQiAqNPyBRCjARIsAKA-WFx7FXrHxUFYiARWGvIwGJv1C6SmBrkajO5Ak_vGuQcSB3J15Uo0UyIaAtEaEALw_wcB">3Degrees</a> and &nbsp;<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dawnlippert/" target="_blank">Dawn Lippert</a>, CEO, Elemental Excelerator. This breakout session aims to provide strategic processes to help leaders navigate through the challenges, opportunities, and unexpected obstacles of 2020 and beyond. We will showcase both funds and direct deals with the potential to drive material change and provide insights and examples for investors and startup leaders in the sectors of climate, sustainability, and energy.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">B.<strong> <em>Investing in Healthcare Startups - 2020 Edition</em> </strong><br><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fazbashi/">Faz Bashi</a>, Partner at&nbsp;<a href="https://www.bostonmillenniapartners.com/">Boston Millennia</a>, will lead a breakout for current and prospective healthcare investors as well as entrepreneurs to provide some insight into the evolving market, and how the urgent need to invest in healthcare solutions may influence the dollars flowing into the field. He will be joined by <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/arup-roy-burman-7891736/">Dr. Arup Roy-Berman</a>, CEO of <a href="https://www.elemenohealth.com/">Elemeno Health</a> which is on the front lines helping to slow the spread of COVID-19.&nbsp;</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">C. <strong>F<em>unding EdTech Startups During The Health Crisis</em></strong> <br>Facilitated by&nbsp;<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sidharthkakkar/">Sidharth Kakkar</a>, CEO &amp; Co-founder,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.freckle.com/">Freckle Education</a> and &nbsp;<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/allisonebaum/" target="_blank">Allison Baum</a>, General Partner,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.sempervirensvc.com/" target="_blank">SemperVirens Venture Capital</a>. This breakout will provide a lens in which to examine early-stage investment and entrepreneurship within the EdTech vertical. We will explore the changing landscape and array of opportunities to educate children and adults via technology solutions and how the current health crisis is influencing the industry.</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">D. <strong><em>Funding The Pivot: Economic Opportunity Via Small Business</em></strong><br>Led by &nbsp;<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/allisonkelly595/">Allison Kelly</a>, CEO of <a href="https://www.icafundgoodjobs.org/">ICA Fund Good Jobs</a>. This breakout will showcase examples of small businesses that are pivoting not only to survive but to thrive. Additionally, two entrepreneurs, <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ariana-makau/">Ariana Makau</a>, President of <a href="http://nzilani.com/">Nzilani Glass Conservation</a> and <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ericquick/">Eric Quick</a> of <a href="https://www.thetownkitchen.com/">The Town Kitchen</a> will share how they are retooling their companies with an accelerated timeline. Lastly, we’ll examine how investors can “fund the pivot” via direct investments and philanthropic vehicles such as Donor Advised Funds, among other means. </p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>2:00pm</strong>:&nbsp;Founder Pitches Round II&nbsp;<em>(</em><a href="https://www.oneworld.training/demo-day"><em>get more info on each company</em></a><em>)</em></p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Dr. Arup Roy-Burman, Co-Founder &amp; CEO, <a href="https://www.elemenohealth.com/" target="_blank">Elemeno Health</a>: arup@elemenohealth.com&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Olya Irzak, Founder &amp; CEO,<em> </em><a href="https://www.frostmethane.com/" target="_blank">Frost Methane Labs</a>: oirzak@gmail.com&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Jiaxi Fang,&nbsp;PhD, CEO, <a href="https://appliedparticletechnology.com/" target="_blank">Applied Particle Technology</a>: jfang@appliedparticletechnology.com&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;">Julie Corbett, CEO &amp; Founder, <a href="https://ecologicbrands.com/" target="_blank">Ecologic Brands</a>: julie@ecologicbrands.com&nbsp;</p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><a href="https://appliedparticletechnology.com/" target="_blank"> </a>Michael Lombardo, Founder &amp; CEO, <a href="https://www.booknooklearning.com/" target="_blank">BookNook</a>: michael@booknooklearning.com&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>2:45pm</strong>: Judges feedback round II&nbsp;</p><ul data-rte-list="default"><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><a href="https://www.cooley.com/people/erik-edwards">Erik Edwards</a>, Partner,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.cooley.com/people/erik-edwards">Cooley LLP</a></p></li><li><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/victoriatreyger/" target="_blank">Victoria Treyger</a>,&nbsp;General Partner &amp; Managing Director,&nbsp;<a href="https://www.felicis.com/" target="_blank">Felicis Ventures</a></p></li></ul><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>3:00pm:&nbsp;</strong>Closing</p><p class="" style="white-space:pre-wrap;"><strong>3:30pm:&nbsp;</strong>Virtual Happy Hour</p>
</div>






















